<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>ONYX BLADES · Shakedown Checklist</title>
<style>
  :root{--bg:#0d0906;--panel:#161009;--line:#3a2a17;--text:#e8dcc8;--muted:#9c8a6e;--amber:#f0a828;--amber-b:#ffc95e;--ok:#39d353;--bad:#ff5c5c;--violet:#b06bff}
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:14px/1.65 "Share Tech Mono","Consolas",monospace;padding:24px 16px 80px}
  .wrap{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto}
  h1{font-size:20px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--amber-b);margin:0 0 2px}
  .sub{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
  .prog{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--ok);margin-bottom:22px}
  .prog b{color:var(--amber-b)}
  .phase{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--amber);border-radius:6px;margin:0 0 18px;padding:14px 18px}
  .phase h2{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:var(--amber-b);margin:0 0 4px}
  .phase .when{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px}
  label.step{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);cursor:pointer}
  label.step:last-of-type{border-bottom:none}
  label.step input{margin-top:4px;accent-color:var(--amber);width:15px;height:15px;flex:none}
  label.step input:checked + span{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:line-through}
  .watch{margin:6px 0 6px 26px;padding:8px 12px;border-left:3px solid var(--ok);background:rgba(57,211,83,.06);font-size:12.5px}
  .watch b{color:var(--ok)}
  .watch code{color:var(--ok);background:rgba(57,211,83,.1);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px}
  .note{margin:6px 0 6px 26px;padding:8px 12px;border-left:3px solid var(--violet);background:rgba(176,107,255,.06);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}
  .note b{color:var(--violet)}
  code{color:var(--amber-b)}
  footer{margin-top:26px;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;line-height:1.9}
  .backrow{margin-bottom:14px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .backrow a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px 10px;border-radius:4px}
  .reset{cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px 10px;border-radius:4px;background:none;font-family:inherit}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="backrow">
    <a href="/blades/colonization/">&#9666; BOARD</a>
    <a href="/blades/checklist/">&#9666; CO-OP CHECKLIST</a>
    <a href="/blades/commander/">MY STATS</a>
    <button class="reset" id="resetBtn">&#8635; RESET TICKS</button>
  </div>
  <h1>SHAKEDOWN CHECKLIST</h1>
  <div class="sub">POST-BUILD VERIFICATION &middot; NAMING / TRIPS / CARRIERS / DECK / FRONT DOOR</div>
  <div class="prog">PROGRESS: <b id="prog">0 / 0</b> &middot; ticks save on this device</div>

  <div class="phase">
    <h2>1 &middot; SITE NAMES &mdash; THE HEADLINE</h2>
    <div class="when">On the board. The reason two A-2 outposts stopped being twins.</div>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s1a" /><span>Open the board &rarr; <b>SITE</b> dropdown. It should list <code>Pace Engineering Exchange</code> and <code>Mendy Chemical Productions</code> &mdash; not two identical &ldquo;&hellip; Construction Site&rdquo; rows.</span></label>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s1b" /><span>Select each one. The <b>Shipping Manifest</b> header (and the panel title) shows that facility&rsquo;s name.</span></label>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s1c" /><span>Options read <code>System &middot; Body &mdash; Name</code> (body is short, e.g. <code>A 2</code>, not the whole system repeated).</span></label>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s1d" /><span><b>THE BIG ONE &mdash; next auto-create:</b> with plugin <b>v1.9</b> running, dock at a <b>new</b> construction site (planetary or orbital), let it auto-register, then check the board shows its <b>real facility name</b>, not <code>&lt;system&gt; Construction Site</code>.</span></label>
    <div class="watch"><b>Expected:</b> the plugin captures the name from the <code>Docked</code> event as you arrive, so the new build lands in RavenColonial already named. Confirm EDMC&rsquo;s Blades label reads <code>v1.9</code> first.</div>
    <div class="note"><b>Note:</b> orbital sites (Coriolis/Orbis/asteroid) use the same capture &mdash; if you finish/start a space platform, verify it names correctly too.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="phase">
    <h2>2 &middot; TRIP COUNTER = YOUR SHIP</h2>
    <div class="when">My Stats + the board. Numbers should follow your real hold.</div>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s2a" /><span><b>My Stats</b> shows your <b>current ship</b> + hold (t) + free space.</span></label>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s2b" /><span>The board&rsquo;s <b>Trips Left</b> footnote names <b>your ship</b> (e.g. &ldquo;Panther Clipper Mk II&rdquo;), not a 790t Type-9.</span></label>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s2c" /><span><b>Swap ships</b> in-game, then wait ~30s (no reload): My Stats updates and the trip counts recompute for the new hold.</span></label>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s2d" /><span>Deliver a load: remaining tonnage drops and Trips Left ticks down accordingly.</span></label>
    <div class="watch"><b>Accuracy pass:</b> this is what you wanted to watch &mdash; haul a few runs and confirm the totals track true. If they do, tell Claude to green the trip-counter lamp.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="phase">
    <h2>3 &middot; CARRIERS &mdash; NAME, CALL SIGN, AFFILIATION</h2>
    <div class="when">Needs a build with a linked fleet carrier.</div>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s3a" /><span>A linked carrier shows its <b>name + call sign</b> (not just a market ID).</span></label>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s3b" /><span>A <b>squad-owned</b> carrier shows its owner in squad colours; a carrier that isn&rsquo;t ours is tagged <code>unaffiliated</code>.</span></label>
    <div class="note"><b>If no linked carrier right now:</b> skip &mdash; this one waits until a build has an FC linked. It&rsquo;s the amber lamp on the register until confirmed live.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="phase">
    <h2>4 &middot; TABLET DECK &mdash; MEMBERS-ONLY PERK</h2>
    <div class="when">Fire tablet in Silk, and a quick signed-out check.</div>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s4a" /><span>Signed in: the <b>&#9974; + zoom</b> control sits bottom-right on the board and My Stats.</span></label>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s4b" /><span><b>Signed-out check:</b> open the public home (or the board while logged out) &mdash; the control is <b>gone</b>. Members-only.</span></label>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s4c" /><span>Tap <b>&#9974;</b> &rarr; fills the screen (browser chrome hidden). <b>&minus;/+</b> resizes the text; the zoom sticks when you move between pages.</span></label>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s4d" /><span><b>Nav to clipboard:</b> tap a system&rsquo;s copy button on the tablet &rarr; it lands on the <b>PC</b> clipboard, ready to paste into the galaxy map.</span></label>
  </div>

  <div class="phase">
    <h2>5 &middot; FRONT DOOR &amp; RANKS</h2>
    <div class="when">Public home + Admiral&rsquo;s Desk.</div>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s5a" /><span><b>Signed out</b>, the public home welcome shows the Admiral&rsquo;s message (&ldquo;&hellip;the Admiral is always watching&rdquo;), signed <code>Admiral wickedwisdom66</code>.</span></label>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s5b" /><span>Have the Admiral edit the welcome from the <b>Admiral&rsquo;s Desk</b>; within ~30s it shows on the public home for everyone.</span></label>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s5c" /><span>The Admiral sees the <b>&#9875; ADMIRAL&rsquo;S DESK</b> button on My Stats, can save the welcome &mdash; but does <b>not</b> see the full admin console.</span></label>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s5d" /><span>Squad Access editor (admin console) still adds/removes sign-in emails cleanly.</span></label>
  </div>

  <div class="phase">
    <h2>6 &middot; REGISTER LAMPS &mdash; WHAT TO GREEN</h2>
    <div class="when">Systems Register v1.3. Tell Claude which of these you&rsquo;ve now confirmed.</div>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s6a" /><span>Site names live &rarr; you can green <b>Carrier Identity &amp; Affiliation</b> once carriers are confirmed, and confirm the new naming cards read right.</span></label>
    <label class="step"><input type="checkbox" data-k="s6b" /><span>Decide which still-amber features are proven: <code>Squad Carrier Link</code>, <code>Claims Ledger</code>, <code>Journal Backfill</code>, <code>Auto-Create w/ Attribution</code>, <code>Claim Hot List</code>, <code>Architect Deck</code>, <code>Inara Supplier Cross-Check</code>.</span></label>
    <div class="watch"><b>Hand-off:</b> tick the ones that work in your shakedown and tell Claude &mdash; I&rsquo;ll flip those lamps to green.</div>
  </div>

  <footer>ONYX BLADES &middot; SHAKEDOWN CHECKLIST &middot; ticks persist on this device &middot; o7</footer>
</div>
<script>
(function(){
  var KEY="ob_shakedown_v1";
  var saved={}; try{saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY)||"{}");}catch(e){}
  var boxes=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('input[type=checkbox][data-k]'));
  function upd(){var d=boxes.filter(function(b){return b.checked;}).length;var el=document.getElementById('prog');if(el)el.textContent=d+" / "+boxes.length;}
  boxes.forEach(function(b){
    if(saved[b.dataset.k])b.checked=true;
    b.addEventListener('change',function(){saved[b.dataset.k]=b.checked;try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(saved));}catch(e){}upd();});
  });
  var rb=document.getElementById('resetBtn');
  if(rb)rb.addEventListener('click',function(){saved={};try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}boxes.forEach(function(b){b.checked=false;});upd();});
  upd();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
